ognose der Nachfrage in der Wiederbeschaffungszeit ist der Eingang jeder Bestandsrechnung; das Bestands-Stück der Linie nimmt sie auf."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sebastian-hanisch/croston-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3e283723f5ad7dc3ea68b293692c9b66eebf3a5c79525df4346363b0c251583e","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:45:25.284Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:45:25.284Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Fünftes Stück der Zeitreihen-Prognose-Linie der \"Konzepte\"-Reihe im Portfolio von Sebastian Hanisch – Operations Research und Machine Learning. Der Ast für sporadische Nachfrage: Nachfolger der Exponentiellen Glättung, deren Schwäche – viele Nullen – er aufgreift. Die sechs weiteren Stücke der Linie (Boosting, Prognoseintervalle, Hierarchische Abstimmung, Kombination, Prognose → Bestand, ein vortrainiertes Netz) sind inzwischen gebaut.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sebastian-hanisch/croston-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3e283723f5ad7dc3ea68b293692c9b66eebf3a5c79525df4346363b0c251583e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sebastian-hanisch/croston-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:45:25.284Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T16:51:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sebastian-hanisch/croston-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:45:25.285Z","hash":"3e283723f5ad7dc3ea68b293692c9b66eebf3a5c79525df4346363b0c251583e","originalBytes":14131,"storedBytes":14131,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["die","und","der","ttung","sba","croston","das","einfache","artikel","tsb","gegen","bei","den","ist","mit","orakel","preset","test","mittel","nachfrage","verfahren","von","aus","mae","sind","tag","verzerrung","alpha","auf","bis","ein","eine","gew","nicht","rate","ufigkeit","wiederbeschaffungszeit","ber","menge","rmse","drift","portfolio","rmsse","auslaufende","naiv","null","prognose","sie","tage","adi","einem"